{
  "slug": "lindo-ai",
  "name": "Lindo Ai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI website builder for agencies. Create websites, pages, and blog posts with AI. Manage clients, assign websites, generate magic login links, and allocate credits — all through conversation. 43 tools covering workspace management, content publishing, custom domains, analytics, and team collaboration.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `create-blog` (Creates a blog post on a website using AI), `create-page` (Creates a new page on an existing website using AI), `create-website` (Creates a new website using AI), `manage-clients` (Manages workspace clients — create, list, update, delete clients, assign websites, generate login links, and allocate credits), `manage-content` (Manages pages and blog posts — list, view, publish, update, unpublish, and delete content on websites), `manage-websites` (Manages websites — list, view details, update settings, manage domains, and check analytics)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `lindo-ai`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lindo-ai@claude-community` from `lindoai/claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
